WEBVTT

00:07:27.465 --> 00:07:31.682
It is also time that designers in Africa

00:07:31.706 --> 00:07:34.308
stop looking outside.

00:07:34.332 --> 00:07:36.698
They've been looking
outward for a long time,

00:07:36.722 --> 00:07:39.010
yet what they were looking for

00:07:39.034 --> 00:07:43.963
has been right there
within grasp, right within them.

00:07:43.987 --> 00:07:45.767
Thank you very much.

00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:50.730
(Applause)